# 构造函数与析构函数

## 代码示例与输出

### 代码分析

```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <string>

class Member {
public:
	Member(int a) { std::cout << "Member Constructor" << " " << "num: " << a << std::endl; }
};

class Base1 {
public:
	Member m{ 1 };
	Base1() { std::cout << "Base1 Constructor" << std::endl; }
	virtual ~Base1() { std::cout << "Base1 Destructor" << std::endl; }
	virtual void myfunc() {};
};

class Base2 {
public:
	Member m{ 2 };

	Base2() { std::cout << "Base2 Constructor" << std::endl; }
	virtual ~Base2() { std::cout << "Base2 Destructor" << std::endl; }

	virtual void myfunc() {};
};

class Derived : public Base1, public Base2 {
public:
	Member m{ 3 };

	Derived() { std::cout << "Derived Constructor" << std::endl; }
	~Derived() { std::cout << "Derived Destructor" << std::endl; };

	void myfunc() override {};
};

int main() {
	Derived d1;
	return 0;
}
```

**继承关系示意图：**
![a1c09a81930fd2240e9117118f0aa6c2&#95;MD5&#46;jpg](/notes/n-1801f0c0006b48c4be799a4b8ba4105b/media/e44c1c69ec2d1af027ca3c4d58191896a5d16dc590aeed038ea0e1ec657a7302.jpg)

### 执行结果

- **构造输出：**
```text
Member Constructor num: 1
Base1 Constructor
Member Constructor num: 2
Base2 Constructor
Member Constructor num: 3
Derived Constructor
```

- **析构输出：**
```text
Derived Destructor
Member Destructor num: 3
Base2 Destructor
Member Destructor num: 2
Base1 Destructor
Member Destructor num: 1
```

